# Local dev config for `make rehearse-web` (livekit-server --dev + local processes).
#
# Copy to envs/local.env (gitignored) OR keep using the repo-root .env — the
# token server and agent load `<repo>/.env`. If you prefer one file per env,
# symlink it:  ln -sf envs/local.env .env
#
# Locally the agent runs as a resident uvicorn process with an HTTP /dispatch
# endpoint (not Modal spawn), so AGENT_DISPATCH_URL points at it.

# ── Auth (Clerk) — needed for the billing-gated token server ───────────────────
CLERK_JWKS_URL=
CLERK_ISSUER=

# ── LiveKit (local dev server) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# `make rehearse-web` runs livekit-server --dev on ws://localhost:7880 with the
# default devkey/secret, so these can be left unset locally.
# LIVEKIT_URL=ws://localhost:7880
# LIVEKIT_API_KEY=devkey
# LIVEKIT_API_SECRET=secret

# ── Interactive model endpoint (deployed Modal endpoint; agent + token server) ─
INTERACTIVE_PROVIDER_ENDPOINT=wss://<workspace>--rehearse-interactive-personaplexprovider-serve.modal.run/ws

# ── Local dispatch: token server → agent's HTTP /dispatch on :8766 ─────────────
AGENT_DISPATCH_URL=http://localhost:8766
# AGENT_DISPATCH_PORT=8766
